00\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/1Q7A3593c-banner.jpg\"><span data-alt=\"\"><\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Banner-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><\/div><div class=\"w-slider-json\" onclick='return {&quot;loopRewind&quot;:true,&quot;slidesSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;imageScalePadding&quot;:0,&quot;numImagesToPreload&quot;:2,&quot;arrowsNav&quot;:true,&quot;arrowsNavAutoHide&quot;:false,&quot;transitionType&quot;:&quot;move&quot;,&quot;transitionSpeed&quot;:300,&quot;block&quot;:{&quot;moveEffect&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:300},&quot;controlNavigation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:{&quot;enabled&quot;:true,&quot;pauseOnHover&quot;:true,&quot;delay&quot;:5000},&quot;imageScaleMode&quot;:&quot;fit&quot;,&quot;autoScaleSlider&quot;:true,&quot;autoScaleSliderWidth&quot;:2300,&quot;autoScaleSliderHeight&quot;:500,&quot;fitInViewport&quot;:false}'><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section class=\"l-section wpb_row height_auto\" id=\"first\"><div class=\"l-section-h i-cf\"><div class=\"g-cols vc_row type_default valign_top\"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"w-separator size_small\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section class=\"l-section wpb_row height_medium\" id=\"first\"><div class=\"l-section-h i-cf\"><div class=\"g-cols vc_row type_default valign_top\"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-8 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Welcome to Sherwood Charter School!<\/h2>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column \">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t<h6>Sherwood Charter School is a public school of choice located in Sherwood, Oregon. Founded in 2005, SCS fosters a life-long love of learning in our students, inspiring them to excel academically and reach their full potential.<\/h6>\n\r\n\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<div class=\"w-separator size_small\"><\/div><div class=\"w-btn-wrapper width_auto align_center\"><a class=\"w-btn us-btn-style_1\" href=\"http:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/enrollment\/\" title=\"Enrollment\"><span class=\"w-btn-label\">Want to learn more about joining our SCS family?<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"w-image align_none\"><a class=\"w-image-h\" href=\"http:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/about\/\" title=\"About SCS\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-300x300.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-350x350.png 350w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-200x200.png 200w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025-375x375.png 375w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/niche-best-schools-badge-2025.png 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section class=\"l-section wpb_row height_medium\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;\"><div class=\"l-section-h i-cf\" style=\"padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;\"><div class=\"g-cols vc_row type_default valign_top\"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div tabindex=\"0\" id=\"interactive-banner-1-wrap-7959\" class=\"ult-banner-block ult-adjust-bottom-margin ult-bb-box  banner-style01 \"   style=\"\">\n\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/Confident-JPEG.jpg\" alt=\"null\">\n\t<div class=\"mask opaque-background\" style=\"background:#5e87a1;\">\n\t\t<div  data-ultimate-target='#interactive-banner-1-wrap-7959 .bb-description'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}'  class=\"bb-description ult-responsive\" style=\"font-weight:normal;color:#ffffff;\">Students at SCS are confident. They are in a safe environment to take risks and strive for their personal best, taking learning to the next level. Our students try new things, pose questions, and express ideas in interactive ways, gaining confidence and leadership abilities.<\/div>\n\t<\/div><a class=\"bb-link\" href=\"http:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/academics\/\" title=\"Academics\" ><\/a>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div tabindex=\"0\" id=\"interactive-banner-1-wrap-5922\" class=\"ult-banner-block ult-adjust-bottom-margin ult-bb-box  banner-style01 \"   style=\"\">\n\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/Compassionate-JPEG.jpg\" alt=\"null\">\n\t<div class=\"mask opaque-background\" style=\"background:#a53983;\">\n\t\t<div  data-ultimate-target='#interactive-banner-1-wrap-5922 .bb-description'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}'  class=\"bb-description ult-responsive\" style=\"font-weight:normal;color:#ffffff;\">We believe in cultivating students\u2019 hearts as well as their minds to foster academic excellence and improve school climate. As a part of this, compassion, inclusion and kindness are key aspects at SCS, and are built in with our H.E.A.R.T. skills (Honor, Empathy, Accountability, Respect and Teamwork).<\/div>\n\t<\/div><a class=\"bb-link\" href=\"http:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/academics\/#1540316853403-c764df2b-133e\" ><\/a>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"vc_col-sm-4 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div tabindex=\"0\" id=\"interactive-banner-1-wrap-9295\" class=\"ult-banner-block ult-adjust-bottom-margin ult-bb-box  banner-style01 \"   style=\"\">\n\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/Curious-JPEG.jpg\" alt=\"null\">\n\t<div class=\"mask opaque-background\" style=\"background:#9cb336;\">\n\t\t<div  data-ultimate-target='#interactive-banner-1-wrap-9295 .bb-description'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}'  class=\"bb-description ult-responsive\" style=\"font-weight:normal;color:#ffffff;\">Intellectual curiosity is encouraged at SCS. Students explore and experience hands on learning, participate in interactive projects and are encouraged to pursue their interests in ways which bring learning to life.<\/div>\n\t<\/div><a class=\"bb-link\" href=\"http:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/academics\/#1540316853383-17abf17c-1b2d\" ><\/a>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section class=\"l-section wpb_row height_medium\" id=\"fourth\"><div class=\"l-section-h i-cf\"><div class=\"g-cols vc_row type_default valign_top\"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"w-separator size_small with_line width_default thick_1 style_solid color_border align_center\">