of pesticides on school grounds. Weather permitting, herbicides for weed control will be used on the school grounds on April 18th at 23264 SW Main Street. The area of application will&hellip;<\/div>\t<\/div>\r\n<\/article>\r\n<article class=\"w-grid-item ratio_1x1 size_1x1 post-11307 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized\" data-id=\"11307\">\r\n\t<div class=\"w-grid-item-h\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"w-post-elm post_title usg_post_title_1 entry-title color_link_inherit\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/2025\/02\/13\/school-closed-february-13-2025\/\">School Closed &#8211; February 13, 2025<\/a><\/h2><div class=\"w-hwrapper usg_hwrapper_1 align_left valign_top wrap \"><time class=\"w-post-elm post_date usg_post_date_1 entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-02-13T05:26:36-08:00\"><i class=\"far fa-clock\"><\/i>February 13, 2025<\/time><div class=\"w-post-elm post_author usg_post_author_1 color_link_inherit vcard author\"><i class=\"far fa-user\"><\/i><div class=\"post-author-meta\"><a class=\"post-author-name fn\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/author\/cmcleod\/\">Cheryl McLeod<\/a><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"w-post-elm post_content usg_post_content_1\">Due to the winter weather, Sherwood\u00a0School\u00a0District\u00a0has announced school closures for Thursday, February 13th. As we follow the district&#8217;s decision, SCS will also be closed.<\/div>\t<\/div>\r\n<\/article>\r\n<\/div>\t<div class=\"w-grid-json hidden\" onclick='return {&quot;ajax_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\\\/wp-admin\\\/admin-ajax.php&quot;,&quot;permalink_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\\\/2025\\\/02\\\/13\\\/school-closed-february-13-2025\\\/&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;us_ajax_grid&quot;,&quot;max_num_pages&quot;:34,&quot;infinite_scroll&quot;:0,&quot;template_vars&quot;:{&quot;query_args&quot;:{&quot;post_type&quot;:[&quot;post&quot;],&quot;post_status&quot;:[&quot;p